不定。願爲假王便。』當是時，楚方急圍漢王於滎陽，韓信使者至，發書，漢王大怒，罵曰：『吾困於此，旦暮望若來佐我，乃欲自立爲王！』張良、陳平躡漢王足，因附耳語曰：『漢方不利，寧能禁信之王乎？不如因而立，善遇之，使自爲守。不然，變生。』漢王亦悟，因復罵曰：『大丈夫定諸侯，即爲真王耳，何以假爲！』乃遣張良往立信爲齊王，徵其兵擊楚。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:p021","quote":"漢王之困固陵，用張良計，召齊王信，遂將兵會垓下。項羽已破，髙祖襲奪齊王軍。漢五年正月，徙齊王信爲楚王，都下邳。"}]}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:p016","text":"漢四年，遂皆降平齊。使人言漢王曰：『齊偽詐多變，反覆之國也，南邊楚，不爲假王以鎮之，其勢不定。願爲假王便。』當是時，楚方急圍漢王於滎陽，韓信使者至，發書，漢王大怒，罵曰：『吾困於此，旦暮望若來佐我，乃欲自立爲王！』張良、陳平躡漢王足，因附耳語曰：『漢方不利，寧能禁信之王乎？不如因而立，善遇之，使自爲守。不然，變生。』漢王亦悟，因復罵曰：『大丈夫定諸侯，即爲真王耳，何以假爲！』乃遣張良往立信爲齊王，徵其兵擊楚。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m016-0013","start":13,"end":15,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005105","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m016-0062","start":62,"end":64,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005105","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m016-0068","start":68,"end":70,"surface":"韓信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005099","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m016-0077","start":77,"end":79,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005105","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m016-0107","start":107,"end":109,"surface":"張良","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005128","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m016-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"陳平","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005129","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m016-0113","start":113,"end":115,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005105","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m016-0132","start":132,"end":133,"surface":"信","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005099","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m016-0159","start":159,"end":161,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p005105","status":"contextual_provisio